        {
          "text": "Na aneena na ana ma Isilaeli, akĩmea, Yĩla syana syenyu ikamakũlya aaĩthe masyo ĩvinda yĩla yĩkoka, ikĩmea, Mavia aa nĩ ma kĩ? ",
